comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-09T13:58:39.780Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live regex timeout/redaction and history-redaction searches found the existing audited-redaction lineage and completed wildcard matcher work but no open history regex execution-budget owner. An isolated one-second probe timed out equally for the existing escaped form and the new leading-slash spelling; the linear control completed. This is a pre-existing trusted-caller resource-bound enhancement and is not claimed implemented or a newly confirmed vulnerability."
